# Runtime output. The working folders accumulate hundreds of megabytes of
# capture images, annotated previews, training runs and logs, and every
# project here writes into them. None of that belongs in the repo.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.cache
logs/
captures/
runs/
backup_*/

# Dataset: images/ and labels/ ARE tracked (233 labelled frames — the
# data the cube detector was trained on). The preview and suspect folders
# are annotated throwaways, ~91 MB, and are not.
dataset/preview/
dataset/suspect/

# Pretrained YOLO bases. Re-downloadable from Ultralytics, not ours.
# The two models we trained are tracked: 02-vision-pick/cube_model.pt
# (current) and 02-vision-pick/models/cube_model_v8n.pt (previous).
yolo26n.pt
yolov8n.pt
cube_model_prev.pt

# Environments and archives
.pixi/
.venv/
*.zip
